                    usingFallback: _usingFallback,
                    error: _error,
                    onRetry: _loadAllShops,
                  ),
                ),
                SliverToBoxAdapter(
                  child: Padding(
                    padding: const EdgeInsets.fromLTRB(16, 18, 16, 110),
